        {
          "text": "Mose ahamagara Abisirayeli bose, arababgira, ati Mwiboneye ivy’ Uhoraho yakoze vyose mu maso yanyu mu gihugu ca Egiputa, abigiriye Farawo n’abamenyekana biwe bose, n’igihugu ciwe cose; ",
