              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ntimwagenda murya umutsima, canke ngo munywe vino cank’ inzoga, kugira ngo mumenye yuko nd’ Uhoraho Imana yanyu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.6",
