        },
        {
          "text": "Rāba uyu musi muhagaze imbere y’Uhoraho Imana yanyu mwese: abakuru b’imiryango, n’ abashingantahe banyu, n’abagabisha banyu, n’abagabo mwese bo mu Bisirayeli, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
