        {
          "text": "bakabona yukw ico gihugu cose cabaye amazuku n’umunyu, cahiye uburimbi, ko kitakirimwa, canke ngo kimere, canke ngo kibemwo n’akātsi, ko gisigaye kimeze nk’ukw i Sodomu hākomvomvowe, bo n’i Gomora n’i Adima n’i Seboyimu, ibisagara Uhoraho yakomvomvoje uburake bgiwe n’ubushangashirwe bgiwe; ",
          "type": "text",
