        },
        {
          "text": "bazobaza, mbere n’amahanga yose azobaza, bati Mbega n’iki cateye Uhoraho kugirira ico gihugu artyo? ubgo burake bg’inkazi bururumba bgavuye ku ki? ",
          "type": "text",
